  "$comment": "Playful theme and type stress test, for evaluation only. Orange primary, purple accent, lime-green focus ring, a heavy display face set bigger, black weight, uppercase and tracked out, and lopsided corners. Values picked by eye, not from a brand guide. It uses the shared bindings files unchanged.",
